msgid "Equalizer"
msgstr "Equalizer"

#: src/ui/desktop/preferences.rs:400
msgid ""
"A ten-band equalizer for playback on this computer. It does not affect other "
"devices."
msgstr ""
"Een equalizer met tien banden voor afspelen op deze computer. Andere "
